<view class="page">
  <view class="page-toolbar">
    <button class="guide-button" bindtap="openGuide" aria-label="使用说明">?</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{needsNickname}}" class="profile-block">
    <text class="block-title">设置麻将昵称</text>
    <input type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="onNicknameInput" placeholder="输入昵称" class="input" maxlength="30" />
    <button class="secondary-button" loading="{{savingProfile}}" bindtap="saveProfile">保存昵称</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-heading"><text>创建麻将房</text></view>
  <view class="form-block">
    <input value="{{mahjongRoomCode}}" bindinput="onMahjongRoomCodeInput" placeholder="房间码（选填）" class="input code-input" maxlength="50" />
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{creatingMahjong}}" bindtap="createMahjongRoom">创建房间</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-heading compact"><text>加入麻将房</text></view>
  <view class="form-block">
    <input value="{{mahjongJoinCode}}" bindinput="onMahjongJoinCodeInput" placeholder="输入房间码" class="input code-input" maxlength="50" />
    <button class="secondary-button" loading="{{joiningMahjong}}" bindtap="joinMahjongRoom">加入房间</button>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{guideOpen}}" class="guide-mask" bindtap="closeGuide">
  <view class="guide-modal" catchtap="preventGuideClose">
    <view class="guide-header">
      <text class="guide-dialog-title">使用说明</text>
      <button class="guide-close" bindtap="closeGuide" aria-label="关闭使用说明">×</button>
    </view>
    <scroll-view class="guide-body" scroll-y>
      <view class="guide-section">
        <text class="guide-section-title">麻将</text>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>进入房间即成为成员，点头像即可互相转账。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>茶水费是虚拟账户，用于收取茶位费。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>房主可切换普通模式和坐下模式；坐下模式需入座东南西北四个位置后才能转账。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>普通模式切换坐下模式时需玩家自行入座；切回普通模式时需全部离座。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>转错账可冲正，但只能冲正自己付款的记录。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>房间超过 30 分钟无转账会自动解散，账目归档保留。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>退出房间只退出本局，可随时再次进入，历史余额会自动接上。</text></view>
      </view>

      <view class="guide-section">
        <text class="guide-section-title">德州</text>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>账本号是独立记账本，不同局和不同人可分账本记录。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>新建牌局时记录每位玩家的买入和结余，系统会自动计算净盈亏。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>保存后展示日期、人数和流水，点击记录可展开明细。</text></view>
      </view>

      <view class="guide-section guide-section-last">
        <text class="guide-section-title guide-section-title-common">通用</text>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet guide-bullet-common">·</text><text>麻将房间数据保存在云端，成员可实时同步。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet guide-bullet-common">·</text><text>更换设备后使用同一微信账号即可同步数据。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet guide-bullet-common">·</text><text>历史房间、账本和个人战绩可在“我的”查看。</text></view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
</view>
